              "hideComponent": "false",
              "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
              "text": "<h1><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Sage Nose to Toes</span></span></span></h1>\n<h2>Pre-Op Prepping System</h2>\n<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Clinically proven to address bacteria in the nares, the oral cavity, and on the skin.</span></p>\n",
              "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Oct 15 2024 16:17:29 GMT+0000",
              "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
